        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72856427?u=dd3de24684800b34d8bf72d8b9c409afa7784871&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Add install and enable instructions for Gnome extensions in NixOS.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Why? Because the corresponding <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/stable/#sec-gnome-shell-extensions\" rel=\"nofollow\">current manual section</a> is probably not up-to-date with the latest changes (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"400113336\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/54150\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/54150/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/54150\">#54150</a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related threads :</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://discourse.nixos.org/t/changing-gdm-gsettings-declaratively/49579/8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discourse.nixos.org/t/changing-gdm-gsettings-declaratively/49579/8</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"358391119\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/46433\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/46433/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/46433\">#46433</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform(s)\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\">